  "details": "Currently custom images for Events are limited to VRC+ images due to the fact that you can only select from your own gallery photos when posting an event.  \n\nSince events are a group feature we should be able to select from the group gallery photos as well instead of having to resort to using the banner as the image for events that don't have VRC+ members as hosts.  We have quite a few events per week and usage of custom thumbnails would be useful for all members.",
